-- Issue content tuning T (2026-10-28, owner decisions 2, 4 and 5; plans/mycountry-stress/tuning-T.md).
-- Every seeded national issue template's trigger moves onto realm-relative `rank` conditions (worst 25% / 10% / 3%
-- of the realm by severity, crises also past an absolute floor), the per-evaluation `random` rolls go (the cron now
-- paces issues itself), cooldowns are a quarter of what they were (14 IxDays at least), and four titles/texts lose a
-- doubled % sign. Source of truth: prisma/seeds/national-issue-templates.ts (src/tests/lib/national-issues/
-- template-integrity.test.ts keeps this file in step). Keyed by slug; rows a deploy has no seed for are untouched.
-- Idempotent: a rerun writes the same values.
